  "description": "The Brainograph knowledge-graph MCP server: 20 read tools (resolve, entity, neighbors, subgraph,\n      path, facts, search, gather, passages, browse, timeline, images, articles, overview) over\n      knowledge_db, served on stdio. The canonical transport is the streamable-HTTP /mcp endpoint on\n      bg-knowledgegraph's API host; this tool is the offline/fallback transport and needs its own\n      connection to knowledge_db (KNOWLEDGE_DB_URL or ConnectionStrings__KnowledgeGraph).",
